# Keep Docker build contexts small and avoid leaking local state/secrets
# into images. Build contexts are the monorepo root (see apps/web/Dockerfile
# and apps/worker/Dockerfile).

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github

# Local env files must never be baked into an image. Only .env.example
# (which contains no real values) is safe to keep.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
